# asset pipeline (see scripts/build-assets.mjs, tools/README.md):
# - assets-src/ holds the original, uncompressed .glb/.hdr sources. Not
#   committed for size, but not at risk either — they're already in git
#   history under public/muha/*.glb prior to the KTX2/meshopt pass.
# - .cache/ is scratch output from the strip/compress steps
# - tools/gltfpack is a downloaded platform binary, not source
assets-src/
.cache/
tools/gltfpack

